cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PQ-V2X hierarchical versus flat intrusion detection: code, protocol and results"
abstract: >-
  Computational record for a leakage-aware comparison of a two-stage
  hierarchical detector against a flat 24-class classifier for post-quantum
  cryptography related attacks in vehicle-to-everything communications, on the
  two five-million-record PQ-V2X releases. Contains the pipeline, the protocol
  tests, the run logs and every result file behind the manuscript's tables.
